    "title": "Garbi 100 - Hybrid watch face",
    "description": "A Special Thank You For Using Our App.\r\n\r\nGARBI G100 watchface\r\n\r\n* Features:\r\n- Digital time\r\n- Analog\r\n- Battery\r\n- Step counter\r\n- Step goal\r\n- Hear rate\r\n- Moon phases\r\n- Distance calculation (Mile)\r\n\r\n* Customization:\r\n1 - Touch and hold display\r\n2 - Tap on customize option\r\n\r\n*Installation instructions:\r\n1. Make sure that your watch is connected to your mobile via Bluetooth\r\n2. Install the watch face and make sure that you selected your watch\r\n\r\n*Supported devices:\r\nAll Wear OS devices with API Level 30+",
